OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FApart from an early light
OL,6,Fshower in the north, Monday promises
OL,7,Fto be generally dry with bright or
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Feeling quite warm in
OL,9,Fthe westerly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,12,Fweather looks mostly dry and settled
OL,13,Fduring the period. There will be
OL,14,Fplenty of sunshine, and it will feel
OL,15,Fincreasing warm again in the lighter
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
